{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Tales_of_FrahAkin_logo2.png?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An upcoming <strong>story-driven fantasy RPG</strong>, <i>Tales from Frah\u2019Akin</i> blends the charm of classic RPGs with modern mechanics and <strong>cinematic cutscenes</strong>, all crafted by a solo Polish developer, <strong>Aeghite</strong>, using RPG Maker MZ. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Story_Paragraph.png?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Book2.gif?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of <strong>Ennea</strong>, princess of the <strong>Forest Elves</strong>, and embark on a journey across the magical land of <strong>Frah\u2019Akin</strong>. Uncover the secrets of a looming threat that endangers the elven realm, forge bonds with unique companions, and reveal hidden truths about the past, present, and future. <strong>Your choices will shape the world around you \u2014 and the people in it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In special scenes, you\u2019ll even get to <strong>play as other main characters</strong>, diving into their personal memories and perspectives. Romance, friendship, conflict \u2014 every relationship holds the power to change the course of your story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Characters_Paragraph.png?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Ennea_card2v2.png?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Aehlevander_card2v2.png?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Thomas_card2v2.png?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Lucien_card2v2.png?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Combat_Paragraph.png?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Battle4.gif?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No random encounters! See your enemies before battle and choose when to engage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combo skills</strong> \u2013 Unleash powerful team-based attacks to defeat enemies efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Auto-battle system</strong> \u2013 Speed up battles while farming and leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/World_Paragraph.png?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Fishing_minigame2.gif?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive worldbuilding</strong> \u2013 Interact with NPCs, complete side quests, and uncover rich lore and character backstories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration &amp; rewards</strong> \u2013 Find hidden treasures, uncover secrets, and enjoy various <strong>mini-games</strong> including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa3 Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfbc Playing instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc83 Dancing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e Training animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26cf\ufe0f Mining</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crafting &amp; customization</strong> \u2013 Gather ingredients, craft potions, and forge your own weapons and armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Features_Paragraph.png?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063950/extras/Castle_scene2.gif?t=1749137133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>13 playable characters</strong>, each with a unique skill set, personal questline, and backstory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Two outfit sets per character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>A variety of interactive mini-games.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>No random encounters!</strong> Choose your battles strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Custom hand-drawn art</strong>, including scene-based CGs and expressive character busts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Original soundtrack</strong> with a captivating, fairy-tale-like main theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Character interactions &amp; romances.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>English &amp; Polish language support.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Fully voice-acted demo.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac